        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/dec6dc/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2018-12-17T07:24:46.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I realize this is still a spirit in testing, but for any playtesters out there, I had a question re: Burning Plague's first growth option, specifically the last part:</p>\n<p>Reclaim Cards<br>\nGain Power Card<br>\n<strong>1 Damage per Disease at 0 Range.</strong></p>\n<p>Does the last part of the Growth option just take place in one land, or does it do 1 damage per Disease in <em>*every*</em> land where Burning Plague has Presence?<br>\n&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:52:17.333Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
