        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>I realize this is still a spirit in testing, but for any playtesters out there, I had a question re: Burning Plague's first growth option, specifically the last part:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Reclaim Cards<br />\r\nGain Power Card<br />\r\n<strong>1 Damage per Disease at 0 Range.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Does the last part of the Growth option just take place in one land, or does it do 1 damage per Disease in <em><u>*every*</u></em> land where Burning Plague has Presence?<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>",
